# Fealty to the Realm: "When CARDNAME enters, you become the monarch. The
# monarch controls enchanted creature." Its S:Mode$ Continuous | AffectedDefined$
# Enchanted | GainControl$ Player.isMonarch is read as StaticAbilityContinuous.
# java:597-600 reads it: the first player getDefinedPlayers names (the
# monarch, PlayerProperty.java:85-88) gains control. Once the ETB trigger makes
# the human the monarch, the AI's Bears move to the human's battlefield
# (ADR-0037), still owned by the AI and summoning sick.
startturn human
advance 3
tapformana human 3 U
tapformana human 4 U
tapformana human 5 U
tapformana human 6 U
tapformana human 7 U
queue paygeneric U
queue paygeneric U
queue paygeneric U
queue paygeneric U
queue enchanttarget 2
castspell human 1
resolvestack
